<title>UK: Citibank warrants on Clariant and Zurich Insurance.</title>
<headline>Citibank warrants on Clariant and Zurich Insurance.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA has issued 15.5 million American-style call warrants, in four tranches, on Clariant and Zurich Insurance, lead manager Citibank (Switzerland) said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> WARRANTS    SIZE     STRIKE	ISS PRICE  PREMIUM   GEARING</p>
<p> CLARIANT A  2.5 MLN  450.00 SFR  4.05 SFR   10.5 PCT  11.0 X</p>
<p> CLARIANT B  4.0 MLN  500.00 SFR  2.30 SFR   17.8 PCT  19.3 X</p>
<p> ZURICH A    3.0 MLN  350.00 SFR  3.35 SFR   10.2 PCT  10.4 X</p>
<p> ZURICH	6.0 MLN  400.00 SFR  1.65 SFR   19.7 PCT  21.1 X</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   12.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	08.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  CI3I</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
